urther your deck building power continuously!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/b21fad8b5a265115c71dd9cedaebaa21.poster.avif?t=1767803450\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/b21fad8b5a265115c71dd9cedaebaa21.webm?t=1767803450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/b21fad8b5a265115c71dd9cedaebaa21.mp4?t=1767803450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Updates</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding Support - Decks of Dexterity has powerful modding features that support creating modded cards, treasures, classes, enemies, gameplay modifiers, and campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards - Compete with other deck builders in speed run, endurance, and skill competitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Envoker Class - Wield the power of the elements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/e17036eb64f0e62c667f5bd42c49a917.poster.avif?t=1767803450\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/e17036eb64f0e62c667f5bd42c49a917.webm?t=1767803450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/e17036eb64f0e62c667f5bd42c49a917.mp4?t=1767803450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decks of Dexterity contains awesome music by awesome creato